{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22232","headline":"题座隅 · 白居易","name":"题座隅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手不任执殳，肩不能荷锄。\n量力揆所用，曾不敌一夫。\n幸因笔研功，得升仕进途。\n历官凡五六，禄俸及妻孥。\n左右有兼仆，出入有单车。\n自奉虽不厚，亦不至饥劬。\n若有人及此，傍观爲何如。\n虽贤亦爲幸，况我鄙且愚。\n伯夷古贤人，鲁山亦其徒。\n时哉无奈何，俱化爲饿殍。\n念彼益自媿，不敢忘斯须。\n平生荣利心，破灭无遗余。\n犹恐尘妄起，题此於座隅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}